{"id":"vod_bf_11272","vodId":"11272","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"怪物弹珠新系列 路西法 反叛的堕天使","name_cn":"怪物弹珠新系列 路西法 反叛的堕天使","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-12/20ed0dbaa84ade1da36d054a024a0b55.jpg"},"summary":"WEB动画《路西法 反叛的堕天使》是怪物弹珠2018年新系列动画。焰莲回到曾经住过的街道·神之原，感受到了违和感，他确实应该在这条街道住过，却对那时的事情没有记忆。此时，莲的智能手机突然被安装了从没见过的游戏，其名为《怪物弹珠》。他带着从手机中飞向现实世界的怪物，在街道中展开了战斗！经过战斗，莲注意到了在自己体内沉睡的谜之记忆的正体，以及，怪物弹珠究竟是何物。与握有钥匙的水泽葵、影月明、若叶皆实一起，如今的莲正迈出通往谜团的一步，对于前方沉睡着无法想象的真相一事，仍然一无所知。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 19:56:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"SP","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/SP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwudanzhuxinxilieluxifafanpandeduotianshi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/guaiwuda